<title>ISRAEL: Israel calls Tel Aviv blast an Arab attack.</title>
<headline>Israel calls Tel Aviv blast an Arab attack.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel's Public Security Minister Avigdor Kahalani said a blast at a Tel Aviv cafe on Friday was carried out by Arab guerrllas.</p>
<p>Asked if he was convinced the blast was a &quot;terrorist attack,&quot; Kahalani told reporters: &quot;Yes, yes.&quot; At least three people were feared killed in the explosion.</p>
</text>
